{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134090/extras/ab7a9582b39c701c6a6c6758321a5b75.webp?t=1774440713\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134090/extras/ab7a9582b39c701c6a6c6758321a5b75.poster.avif?t=1774440713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=190 /></picture></span>Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scotland, 2020. Alice is a young woman struggling through a painful breakup. Hoping to distract herself with online shopping, she buys a vintage mirror \u2014 and then whispers begin to echo through her apartment. Soon, she discovers that a mysterious figure is trapped inside the mirror, and only she can help them break free <i>by forming a deeper connection.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134090/extras/372fd3dfbbe003b3bb2ede189e5d67ab.avif?t=1774440713\" width=1500 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black nails and lipstick. Theatrical charm wrapped in sweet words.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is this creature that watches through the mirror? A ghost? A demon? Something far more dangerous? And what intentions do they hide behind that smile?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape Alice\u2019s personality, how she copes with her trauma, and the nature of her relationship with the enigmatic entity known as Dinah. Are they a romantic salvation\u2026 or a dangerous escape from reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this true love, manipulation, or something far stranger? <br>And most importantly \u2014 <strong>who is Dinah, really?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. <strong>1\u20132 hours</strong> of reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive choices</strong> that shape the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique artistic style</strong> blending traditional digital illustration with pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flamboyant, obsessive manipulator</strong> as your romantic interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original atmospheric soundtrack.</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A good buy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/4699efd0223c0c7069d3dcf3a57f4910130f424b.jpg"},{"name":"Absolutely, definitely a normal mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/05e89d74da2f5db78f7bc443920db33e5d3a112c.jpg"},{"name":"I had a really tough day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/5b9384496cdc7a51d09cc26c0842a47d744f4694.jpg"},{"name":"I can fix them","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/b28a84ca09fd63d6f2eada314be18cebf039310c.jpg"},{"name":"The one who came through the looking glass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/331f099708322f155050a01e15116875cae857cf.jpg"},{"name":"Carmine flag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/46ac462d0430f5a289e44a0c248c6b894b0a9705.jpg"},{"name":"Kiss and make up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/27ed4969a6d8c16d841043800a70a2397fa0be5a.jpg"},{"name":"The photo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/59bd77501de65bb2cfee19380cf848f2ceffb955.jpg"},{"name":"Who did this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134090/ecc27c479b6b002dffe3491bdfcca1edaccf61b6.jpg"},{"name":"Imaginary, but not quite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco